// Title: Potential Password Spraying Attempt Using Dsacls.EXE
// Rule ID: bac9fb54-2da7-44e9-988f-11e9a5edbc0c
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1218
// Category: process_creation
